@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`
IMPORT `ito-s40c-academic-degree`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests for s 40C. Row IL-27. Expected values worked by hand from lines 1655-1672 before the rules were run; none edited.
-- First text (studies ended in 2023 or later): first degree 1 point, second 1/2, in min(years, 3) and min(years, 2) tax years from the tax
-- year after the studies ended. Second text (studies ended 2014-2022): one tax year, elected. (d)(1) is fork F5.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — section 40C`

-- Builders. The fields: tax year; resident; kind; entitled; years of study; the tax year the studies ended; for a direct track the
-- years of first-degree study and the tax year they ended; proof given; internship; elected after the internship; the two elections;
-- foreign worker.
GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `kind`     IS A `A kind of academic studies, for section 40C`
      `years`    IS A NUMBER
      `ended`    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
`in` `the year` `, studies of kind` `kind` `for` `years` `years, ended in` `ended` MEANS
    `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF `the year`, TRUE, `kind`, TRUE, `years`, `ended`, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE,
        `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `kind`     IS A `A kind of academic studies, for section 40C`
      `years`    IS A NUMBER
      `ended`    IS A NUMBER
      `began`    IS A NUMBER
      `finished` IS A NUMBER
      `elected`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
`in` `the year` `, studies of kind` `kind` `for` `years` `years, ended in` `ended` `, internship from` `began` `to` `finished` `, elected after it:` `elected` MEANS
    `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF `the year`, TRUE, `kind`, TRUE, `years`, `ended`, 0, 0, TRUE, JUST (`An internship, for section 40C(c1)` OF `began`, `finished`), `elected`,
        `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `kind`     IS A `A kind of academic studies, for section 40C`
      `years`    IS A NUMBER
      `ended`    IS A NUMBER
      `first`    IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
      `second`   IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
GIVETH AN `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
`in` `the year` `, studies of kind` `kind` `for` `years` `years, ended in` `ended` `, electing` `first` `and` `second` MEANS
    `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF `the year`, TRUE, `kind`, TRUE, `years`, `ended`, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `first`, `second`, FALSE

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `kind`     IS A `A kind of academic studies, for section 40C`
      `years`    IS A NUMBER
      `ended`    IS A NUMBER
      `began`    IS A NUMBER
      `finished` IS A NUMBER
      `first`    IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
GIVETH AN `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
`in` `the year` `, studies of kind` `kind` `for` `years` `years, ended in` `ended` `, internship from` `began` `to` `finished` `, electing` `first` MEANS
    `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF `the year`, TRUE, `kind`, TRUE, `years`, `ended`, 0, 0, TRUE, JUST (`An internship, for section 40C(c1)` OF `began`, `finished`), FALSE, `first`, `first`, FALSE

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `years`    IS A NUMBER
      `ended`    IS A NUMBER
      `first years` IS A NUMBER
      `first ended` IS A NUMBER
      `first election`  IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
      `second election` IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
GIVETH AN `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
`in` `the year` `, a direct track of` `years` `years ended in` `ended` `, the first degree of` `first years` `years ended in` `first ended` `, electing` `first election` `and` `second election` MEANS
    `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF `the year`, TRUE, `a direct track to a third academic degree`, TRUE, `years`, `ended`, `first years`, `first ended`, TRUE, NOTHING, FALSE, `first election`, `second election`, FALSE

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `resident` IS A BOOLEAN
      `entitled` IS A BOOLEAN
      `proof`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `foreign`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
`in` `the year` `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` `resident` `, entitled:` `entitled` `, proof given:` `proof` `, foreign worker:` `foreign` MEANS
    `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF `the year`, `resident`, `a first academic degree`, `entitled`, 3, 2023, 0, 0, `proof`, NOTHING, FALSE,
        `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `foreign`

§§ `The first text — a first degree`

-- Three years of study, ended in 2023: one point in 2024, 2025 and 2026; nothing in 2027.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
-- Four years of study: still three tax years (the cap). Two years: two tax years. One year: one.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 4 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 4 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 1 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 1 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
-- The studies ended in the tax year asked about: the point starts the year after.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2024) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2024) EQUALS 1

§§ `The first text — a second degree`

#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 1 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
-- Three years of study for a second degree: held to two tax years.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0

§§ `The first text — the internship (c1)`

-- Studies ended 2023; internship 2024 to 2025 (begun by 2024, the tax year after); elected: the point starts in 2026.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2024 `to` 2025 `, elected after it:` TRUE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2024 `to` 2025 `, elected after it:` TRUE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2028 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2024 `to` 2025 `, elected after it:` TRUE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2029 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2024 `to` 2025 `, elected after it:` TRUE) EQUALS 0
-- Not elected: the start is the tax year after the studies.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2024 `to` 2025 `, elected after it:` FALSE) EQUALS 1
-- An internship that began in 2025, after the tax year after the studies (2024): the election is not open to him.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2025 `to` 2026 `, elected after it:` TRUE) BECAUSE "the election to count the point from the tax year after the internship is open only for a degree in a field requiring an internship, begun by the tax year after the studies ended"
-- Begun in 2024, the tax year after the studies: the boundary, open.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 1 `years, ended in` 2023 `, internship from` 2024 `to` 2025 `, elected after it:` TRUE) EQUALS 1
-- An election after an internship that the record does not hold.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` OF 2026, TRUE, `a first academic degree`, TRUE, 3, 2023, 0, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, TRUE, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`, FALSE) BECAUSE "the election to count the point from the tax year after the internship is open only for a degree in a field requiring an internship, begun by the tax year after the studies ended"

§§ `The first text — a third degree in medicine or dentistry (d)(1), fork F5`

-- Studies ended 2023. Together: 1 point in 2024-2026 and 1/2 point in 2024-2025. The half point follows: 1/2 in 2027-2028.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the two runs start together` `, for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the two runs start together` `, for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the two runs start together` `, for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the two runs start together` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2028 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2029 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
-- The default declines where the two differ (2024, 2025, 2027, 2028) and answers where they agree (2026: 1; 2029: 0).
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) BECAUSE "section 40C(d)(1) does not say whether the point and the half point run together or one after the other, and here the readings differ"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) BECAUSE "section 40C(d)(1) does not say whether the point and the half point run together or one after the other, and here the readings differ"
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2029 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `section 40C — the reading row IL-27 takes of (d)(1)` EQUALS `declined where the readings differ`

§§ `The first text — a direct track to a third degree (d)(2)`

-- First-degree studies of 3 years ended in 2022: a point in 2023, 2024, 2025. Third degree ended 2023: half a point in 2024 and 2025.
-- 2024 and 2025: 1 + 1/2 = 3/2. 2026: nothing.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2023 `, the first degree of` 3 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2023 `, the first degree of` 3 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2023 `, the first degree of` 3 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`) EQUALS 0
-- First-degree studies of 2 years ended in 2020: a point in 2021 and 2022 only; in 2024 the half point alone.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2023 `, the first degree of` 2 `years ended in` 2020 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`) EQUALS 1/2
-- Five years of first-degree study are held to three tax years: ended 2022, 2025 is the last.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2026 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2023 `, the first degree of` 5 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`) EQUALS 0

§§ `The second text — studies that ended in 2014 to 2022`

-- Studies ended 2022. The election "the tax year after" is 2023: nothing in 2024. "The tax year after that" is 2024: one point; then nothing in 2025.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 1/2
-- (c1), second text: studies ended 2021, internship 2022 to 2023 (begun by 2022): the year after the internship is 2024.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2021 `, internship from` 2022 `to` 2023 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the internship ended`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2021 `, internship from` 2022 `to` 2023 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the internship ended`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2021 `, internship from` 2023 `to` 2023 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the internship ended`) BECAUSE "the election to count the point from the tax year after the internship is open only for a degree in a field requiring an internship, begun by the tax year after the studies ended"
-- A third degree, studies ended 2022, start by election 2024. Together: 3/2 in 2024. The half point follows: 1 in 2024, 1/2 in 2025.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the two runs start together` `, for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the half point follows the point` `, for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C, reading (d)(1) as` `the two runs start together` `, for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry` `for` 6 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) BECAUSE "section 40C(d)(1) does not say whether the point and the half point run together or one after the other, and here the readings differ"
-- A direct track, second text: both ended 2022, both elected 2024: 1 + 1/2 in 2024. The first elected 2023: only the half point in 2024.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2022 `, the first degree of` 3 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2022 `, the first degree of` 3 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a direct track of` 6 `years ended in` 2022 `, the first degree of` 3 `years ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 0

§§ `The vintage boundaries`

-- Studies that ended before 2014: the text is not in the source bundle.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2013) BECAUSE "row IL-27 does not hold the text of section 40C for studies that ended before 2014"
-- 2014 is the first year of the second text: one point in the year elected (2016 for "after that"), none in 2024.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2014 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 0
-- 2022 is the last year of the second text, 2023 the first of the first: ended 2022 with "after that" gives 2024 (one point, one year); ended 2023 gives 2024-2026.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2022 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2023 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2022) BECAUSE "row IL-27 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024"

§§ `The conditions; section 48A; one first and one second degree (e)`

-- Not resident, no proof given, not entitled: no point. A foreign worker who would have one: refused (s 48A).
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` FALSE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` FALSE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` FALSE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2025 `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` TRUE) BECAUSE "section 48A and the regulations made under it are not encoded in this model"
-- A foreign worker with nothing to take away (2027): 0.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for` (`in` 2027 `, a first degree of 3 years ended in 2023; resident:` TRUE `, entitled:` TRUE `, proof given:` TRUE `, foreign worker:` TRUE) EQUALS 0
-- A first and a second degree, both ended 2023, in 2024: 1 + 1/2 = 3/2. Two first degrees: the section does not say which.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` (LIST (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023)) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` (LIST (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2021 `, electing` `the tax year after that` `and` `the tax year after that`)) BECAUSE "section 40C(e) credits one first degree and one second degree and does not say which of several is the one"

§§ `v0.1.1 — (e): the choice of "the one" matters only where it changes the answer`

-- Two identical first degrees (3 years, ended 2023), tax year 2026: each choice gives 1, so 1. In 2027 each gives 0.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` (LIST (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2026 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023)) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` (LIST (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2027 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023)) EQUALS 0
-- Two identical first degrees and one second degree (2 years, ended 2023), tax year 2024: 1 + 1/2 = 3/2. Two identical second degrees alone: 1/2.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` (LIST (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a first academic degree` `for` 3 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023)) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` (LIST (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023), (`in` 2024 `, studies of kind` `a second academic degree` `for` 2 `years, ended in` 2023)) EQUALS 1/2
